.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt PS 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm ps
.Nd list services from the svc: scheme
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl -selftest
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads the directory
.Pa svc:
and each
.Pa svc:/<name>
status record, and prints one line per service:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
NAME STATE RESTARTS
.Ed
.Pp
The state is one of
.Ql stopped ,
.Ql starting ,
.Ql running ,
.Ql restarting ,
.Ql failed
or
.Ql gave-up .
.Pp
.Fl -selftest
reads every status record, checks that the directory is non-empty and every
line parses, and prints
.Dq ps: selftest ok .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
A missing or malformed
.Pa svc:
record exits with status 1.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr svcctl 1 ,
.Xr init 8
.Sh STANDARDS
The output is a RavenBSD service view, not the process table of a POSIX
.Nm
utility.
